WEBVTT

01:35.890 --> 01:40.830
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.650 --> 01:43.940
[Episode 15]

01:59.150 --> 01:59.950
First Prince.

02:01.040 --> 02:03.510
Since His Majesty no longer
holds him accountable,

02:03.510 --> 02:04.950
then please leave the punishment

02:04.950 --> 02:06.280
of General Xun to me.

02:08.240 --> 02:08.840
Sure.

02:17.520 --> 02:18.329
First Prince!

02:18.360 --> 02:19.490
You've gone too far!

02:19.910 --> 02:22.190
Princess Xiyang's wedding is
just around the corner.

02:22.190 --> 02:24.240
I hope you'll keep the bigger picture
in mind

02:24.240 --> 02:26.700
and not break royal protocol,
First Prince.

02:28.470 --> 02:29.750
You want dignity?

02:29.960 --> 02:31.400
Then listen carefully.

02:32.079 --> 02:33.430
From now on, if anyone dares

02:33.430 --> 02:34.760
to harm Fu Yixiao again,

02:36.430 --> 02:38.280
I'll definitely kill them.

02:42.120 --> 02:46.980
[Ning'an Hall]

02:50.720 --> 02:56.150
[Wutong Mansion]

03:05.910 --> 03:10.060
[Wutong Mansion]

03:09.630 --> 03:10.290
Where is he?

03:13.630 --> 03:14.430
Guess who I am?

03:17.840 --> 03:18.820
Why did you do that?

03:18.820 --> 03:19.950
Are you in a bad mood?

03:20.450 --> 03:21.710
Which blind fool

03:21.460 --> 03:22.810
[Wutong Mansion]

03:21.710 --> 03:23.400
had the nerve to offend our First Prince?

03:23.400 --> 03:24.190
Weren't you supposed to be at the border

03:24.190 --> 03:25.150
with the Elder Marquis?

03:25.150 --> 03:26.610
Why are you suddenly back?

03:27.400 --> 03:29.030
Well, it's Princess Xiyang's wedding soon,
isn't it?

03:29.030 --> 03:29.710
Can't our Murong family

03:29.710 --> 03:30.310
at least send someone back

03:30.310 --> 03:31.560
to attend the ceremony?

03:31.560 --> 03:33.220
I was going to come back alone,

03:33.240 --> 03:35.500
but my father insisted on coming with me.

03:35.520 --> 03:37.430
The Elder Marquis is back in Yujing too?

03:37.430 --> 03:38.030
Yes.

03:39.470 --> 03:40.560
Since you're in a bad mood,

03:40.560 --> 03:43.020
how about I go with you for
a couple of drinks?

03:43.430 --> 03:45.079
Please let the Elder Marquis know

03:45.079 --> 03:45.680
that I'll definitely pay him a visit

03:45.680 --> 03:47.340
in person when I have the time.

03:48.890 --> 03:50.030
You really aren't coming drinking with me?

03:50.030 --> 03:51.240
I'll go by myself then.

03:51.240 --> 03:51.770
Go ahead.

03:51.800 --> 03:52.710
I'm really going, you know?

03:52.710 --> 03:53.340
Just go.

04:04.030 --> 04:04.470
Lu Ke.

04:06.030 --> 04:06.560
Lu Ke.

04:08.710 --> 04:09.310
What exactly happened

04:09.310 --> 04:10.370
in the court today?

04:11.230 --> 04:13.090
His Highness acted rashly today.

04:13.120 --> 04:13.840
Why was His Highness

04:13.840 --> 04:15.520
removed from the position
of secondary officiant?

04:15.520 --> 04:16.870
Today, His Highness mentioned
the late Empress's death

04:16.870 --> 04:18.430
in front of His Majesty.

04:19.680 --> 04:20.120
But...

04:21.070 --> 04:23.240
Doesn't His Majesty forbid anyone
from mentioning...

04:23.240 --> 04:24.680
Since you know it's forbidden,
why bring it up?

04:24.680 --> 04:27.080
Weren't you the one
who brought it up first?

04:27.470 --> 04:28.270
I know.

04:28.770 --> 04:29.870
All these years,

04:29.920 --> 04:30.920
when has His Highness ever

04:30.920 --> 04:32.240
mentioned this in front of His Majesty?

04:32.240 --> 04:33.000
And it's precisely because of this

04:33.000 --> 04:33.830
that the father and son
were able to preserve

04:33.830 --> 04:35.430
the last shred of their bond.

04:35.600 --> 04:36.409
But today,

04:36.800 --> 04:37.890
His Majesty clearly knew Empress Zhuang

04:37.890 --> 04:38.800
wanted to harm Miss Yixiao,

04:38.800 --> 04:40.200
yet he turned a blind eye.

04:40.750 --> 04:42.950
What else could His Highness have done?

04:44.159 --> 04:45.390
His Highness must have thought of

04:45.390 --> 04:46.790
the late Empress's death,

04:46.790 --> 04:47.920
so in a moment of panic,

04:47.920 --> 04:49.520
he spoke without restraint.

04:49.830 --> 04:50.950
Even so,

04:51.159 --> 04:52.040
they shouldn't let the Second Prince

04:52.040 --> 04:53.190
take His Highness's place.

04:53.190 --> 04:54.120
Princess Xiyang

04:54.190 --> 04:55.430
is His Highness's biological sister,

04:55.430 --> 04:55.920
and His Highness

04:55.920 --> 04:57.270
is His Majesty's eldest son.

04:57.270 --> 04:58.720
By every measure—emotionally, logically,
publicly, and privately—

04:58.720 --> 05:01.320
this matter shouldn't have ended up
like this.

05:03.040 --> 05:03.830
From now on, you may say

05:03.830 --> 05:05.290
such things in front of me,

05:05.390 --> 05:06.820
but keep your mouth shut out there.

05:06.820 --> 05:10.420
You think His Highness doesn't
have enough on his plate already?

05:10.720 --> 05:11.920
His Highness fought for Susha

05:11.920 --> 05:12.980
on bloody battlefields.

05:12.980 --> 05:13.630
But in the end,

05:13.630 --> 05:15.190
who appreciates what he's done?

05:15.190 --> 05:16.800
I shouldn't have let him go
in the first place.

05:16.800 --> 05:18.260
Shouldn't have let him go?

05:18.390 --> 05:19.720
Would he have listened to you?

05:19.720 --> 05:20.510
Once His Highness makes a decision,

05:20.510 --> 05:21.480
who can stop him?

05:22.310 --> 05:23.270
Back then, it was people from Jinxiu

05:23.270 --> 05:24.310
who kept trying to assassinate
Miss Yixiao.

05:24.310 --> 05:24.950
But now,

05:25.040 --> 05:26.160
someone from our Susha Kingdom
wants to kill her,

05:26.160 --> 05:27.390
right under His Highness's nose.

05:27.390 --> 05:28.920
How could he not intervene?

05:30.340 --> 05:31.800
Others may not understand

05:31.800 --> 05:33.000
why His Highness did that,

05:33.000 --> 05:34.190
but both of us know clearly

05:34.190 --> 05:34.920
that he did it just to

05:34.920 --> 05:35.870
send a message to Prime Minister Zhuang,
Empress Zhuang,

05:35.870 --> 05:37.130
and everyone else that

05:37.430 --> 05:39.800
from now on,
anyone who dares lay a hand on Miss Yixiao

05:39.800 --> 05:41.800
will meet the same fate as Xun Xiang.

05:43.040 --> 05:44.190
I really don't know
whether you're truly clever

05:44.190 --> 05:45.590
or just pretending to be.

05:51.720 --> 05:53.040
It seems the First Prince

05:53.040 --> 05:55.560
has completely enraged His Majesty
this time.

05:55.560 --> 05:57.000
Do you think His Majesty's actions

05:57.000 --> 05:57.800
indicate he intends to appoint Chengyang

05:57.800 --> 05:59.040
as the Crown Prince?

05:59.310 --> 06:01.160
His Majesty's mind is hard to read.

06:01.160 --> 06:02.290
It's still too early

06:02.310 --> 06:03.710
to speculate about that.

06:04.270 --> 06:04.810
However,

06:05.270 --> 06:07.000
I've already sent people
to spread this matter

06:07.000 --> 06:08.600
widely outside the palace.

06:09.240 --> 06:11.680
By now, throughout Yujing City,

06:12.190 --> 06:14.000
I believe everyone has known that
the First Prince

06:14.000 --> 06:15.660
has lost the Emperor's favor.

06:16.070 --> 06:17.040
In that case,

06:17.830 --> 06:18.510
the situation becomes

06:18.510 --> 06:19.970
even more favorable to us.

06:21.240 --> 06:22.100
That Feng Suige

06:22.120 --> 06:23.630
is still too young and naive,

06:23.630 --> 06:25.290
thinking he can challenge us.

06:26.100 --> 06:27.690
How many times have I told you

06:27.690 --> 06:28.600
that Feng Suige

06:28.600 --> 06:30.440
is not as simple as you imagine.

06:30.680 --> 06:32.360
You mustn't let your guard down.

06:32.360 --> 06:33.920
As for the matter of the ritual,

06:33.920 --> 06:36.180
it seems to me that he doesn't care
at all.

06:36.360 --> 06:38.310
Father, why do you always
build up others' presence

06:38.310 --> 06:39.920
at the cost of our own authority?

06:39.920 --> 06:40.750
In my opinion,

06:41.159 --> 06:42.310
he simply can't let go of

06:42.310 --> 06:44.370
the grievances his mother suffered,

06:44.480 --> 06:47.409
thus he keeps looking for ways
to pick fights with us.

06:50.510 --> 06:51.270
Mother!

06:55.750 --> 06:56.880
Greetings, Mother.

06:57.040 --> 06:58.390
Greetings, Grandfather.

06:58.390 --> 07:00.320
Why are you running in such a hurry?

07:00.480 --> 07:02.210
Look at you, sweating all over.

07:02.240 --> 07:03.920
Be careful not to catch a cold.

07:04.070 --> 07:04.630
Mother,

07:05.160 --> 07:06.160
why has Father suddenly assigned me

07:06.160 --> 07:08.070
to serve as the secondary officiant
at the Ancestral Ceremony?

07:08.070 --> 07:09.200
What about Brother?

07:09.240 --> 07:10.120
Anything happened to him?

07:10.120 --> 07:11.520
Why do you care about him?

07:11.800 --> 07:12.930
Just remember this:

07:13.070 --> 07:14.270
listen to your father

07:14.480 --> 07:15.680
and don't go against him.

07:15.680 --> 07:17.480
There will be plenty of benefits
for you in the future.

07:17.480 --> 07:19.190
Don't follow your brother's example.

07:19.190 --> 07:20.160
I don't know what Brother

07:20.160 --> 07:21.530
has done wrong,

07:21.750 --> 07:24.000
but he's definitely not
that kind of person.

07:24.000 --> 07:25.390
You may see him as your brother,

07:25.390 --> 07:27.520
but he might not treat you the same way.

07:27.630 --> 07:28.760
Don't overthink it.

07:29.950 --> 07:31.560
Your father must have his reasons

07:31.560 --> 07:33.290
for making such arrangements.

07:33.360 --> 07:34.890
Just listen to your mother.

07:35.190 --> 07:36.450
Don't defy His Majesty

07:37.120 --> 07:38.230
or make him angry.

07:38.390 --> 07:39.870
But according to ancestral tradition,

07:39.870 --> 07:40.630
the role of secondary officiant
at the Ancestral Ceremony

07:40.630 --> 07:42.490
should be performed by Brother.

07:42.630 --> 07:44.090
If I take Brother's place,

07:44.120 --> 07:44.850
then how will

07:44.950 --> 07:45.870
the court officials

07:45.870 --> 07:46.870
and the citizens of Yujing City

07:46.870 --> 07:48.130
view him in the future?

07:48.190 --> 07:49.680
And how will Brother be able to

07:49.680 --> 07:51.920
hold his head up in Yujing City
after that?

07:51.920 --> 07:53.000
I'll go ask Father

07:53.600 --> 07:54.950
to revoke his decree right now.

07:54.950 --> 07:56.800
If you dare to go ask your father that,

07:56.800 --> 07:57.600
then from now on,

07:57.600 --> 07:59.260
don't call me Mother anymore!

08:00.800 --> 08:01.510
Chengyang.

08:04.000 --> 08:06.070
Your mother is doing this
for your own good.

08:06.070 --> 08:07.510
Don't let her down.

08:14.270 --> 08:16.690
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

08:39.080 --> 08:40.230
Issue this order:

08:40.960 --> 08:43.240
from now on, no one

08:43.240 --> 08:45.440
is allowed to mention the late Empress.

08:45.630 --> 08:46.720
Yes, Your Majesty.

08:51.000 --> 08:51.630
Father,

08:52.130 --> 08:53.370
Mother was wronged.

08:54.060 --> 08:55.780
She wasn't a spy of Jinxiu.

08:55.800 --> 08:57.930
I beg you to uncover the truth, Father.

09:07.150 --> 09:08.030
Father!

09:08.870 --> 09:09.790
Father!

09:10.870 --> 09:12.440
Mother was wronged!

09:13.600 --> 09:14.790
Father!

09:16.320 --> 09:17.600
Father!

09:17.680 --> 09:20.730
[Eternal Radiance of Virtue]

09:24.870 --> 09:25.360
Stop.

09:30.080 --> 09:32.880
If you still refuse to
address her properly today,

09:33.770 --> 09:36.200
I will no longer consider you my son.

09:47.100 --> 09:49.240
[Grace in Blessed Accord]

09:52.080 --> 09:52.910
First Prince,

09:53.630 --> 09:54.550
don't make your father

09:54.550 --> 09:56.030
worry about this matter anymore.

09:56.030 --> 09:57.890
He's already burdened with state affairs.

09:57.890 --> 09:59.000
Can't you be a bit more considerate

09:59.000 --> 09:59.860
of your father?

10:02.960 --> 10:05.130
He's only asking you to call me "Mother."

10:05.130 --> 10:07.100
Why are you so unwilling to say it?

10:11.000 --> 10:11.870
In your dreams.

10:14.030 --> 10:14.720
Beat him.

10:41.060 --> 10:43.370
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

10:41.750 --> 10:42.550
Mother,

10:44.240 --> 10:45.640
if you were still around,

10:46.630 --> 10:50.720
[Eternal Radiance of Virtue]

10:47.320 --> 10:48.270
you wouldn't want me

10:48.270 --> 10:49.750
to defy him like this.

10:53.870 --> 10:56.600
But he isn't worthy of being a father,

10:58.310 --> 11:00.190
let alone of being your husband.

11:00.040 --> 11:03.020
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

11:06.040 --> 11:08.660
[Virtuous and Serene, Honored in Peace]

11:16.950 --> 11:24.670
[Virtuous and Serene, Honored in Peace]

11:25.310 --> 11:26.310
Why are you here?

11:28.790 --> 11:30.260
You were paying respects to your mother.

11:30.260 --> 11:31.860
I didn't want to disturb you,

11:32.010 --> 11:33.370
so I waited outside.

11:34.510 --> 11:36.040
Have you been waiting long?

11:37.150 --> 11:37.960
I remembered some

11:37.960 --> 11:39.360
clues about Meng Junran.

11:39.820 --> 11:41.870
Would you like to check them out with me?

11:41.870 --> 11:42.360
Sure.

11:42.900 --> 11:43.790
Come with me.

11:49.000 --> 11:51.390
This is what the wedding envoy asked me

11:51.440 --> 11:53.360
to deliver to you, Prince of Zhennan.

11:53.360 --> 11:55.490
He said it was bestowed by the Emperor.

12:01.390 --> 12:02.030
Prince of Zhennan,

12:02.030 --> 12:03.630
if you have no other matters,

12:03.630 --> 12:05.320
I shall take my leave.

12:59.820 --> 13:04.730
By the Mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor of Jinxiu

13:05.320 --> 13:06.840
decrees:

13:08.110 --> 13:09.600
Prince of Zhennan,

13:10.120 --> 13:11.840
Xia Jingshi,

13:12.120 --> 13:14.670
excels in both civil and military affairs.

13:15.120 --> 13:19.030
Since taking charge of the border defense,

13:19.440 --> 13:25.320
the Prince of Zhennan has been able to
share my burdens,

13:25.480 --> 13:30.750
truly serving as my right-hand man.

13:31.360 --> 13:33.030
His Highness is already in this condition,

13:33.030 --> 13:35.030
yet you're still going on and on reading?

13:35.030 --> 13:36.320
Where was I?

13:36.440 --> 13:37.030
You...

13:40.600 --> 13:41.360
By the...

13:42.390 --> 13:44.750
Mandate of Heaven,

13:45.480 --> 13:48.030
the Emperor of Jinxiu

13:48.630 --> 13:51.200
decrees...

14:07.150 --> 14:11.080
So it is commanded.

14:12.360 --> 14:13.820
Are you finished reading?

14:13.960 --> 14:15.160
Give me the antidote!

14:20.440 --> 14:22.160
[Uphold Virtue to Honor the Ancients]

14:34.910 --> 14:36.320
[Uphold Virtue to Honor the Ancients]

14:39.550 --> 14:41.150
Ning Fei, escort Mr. Gao out.

14:49.240 --> 14:50.100
Your Highness!

14:51.150 --> 14:52.010
Your Highness.

14:53.120 --> 14:53.670
Here.

14:59.200 --> 15:00.240
Your Highness, you...

15:00.240 --> 15:01.500
Why are you doing this?

15:02.390 --> 15:03.390
If I have to wait for

15:03.390 --> 15:05.200
the Emperor's antidote every month,

15:05.200 --> 15:06.730
when will I ever break free?

15:07.480 --> 15:08.480
From now on,

15:09.720 --> 15:11.650
I must start saving the antidotes.

15:13.150 --> 15:13.990
Only then

15:14.630 --> 15:15.760
will I have a way out.

15:16.030 --> 15:17.760
But if you only take half a pill,

15:18.150 --> 15:20.280
its effect will definitely be halved.

15:20.480 --> 15:21.080
What if...

15:21.630 --> 15:23.390
Even if I'm in unbearable pain,

15:24.630 --> 15:26.240
you absolutely must not give me

15:26.240 --> 15:27.220
this half pill.

15:27.870 --> 15:29.270
This is a military order.

15:29.670 --> 15:30.510
Understood?

15:31.720 --> 15:32.320
Yes.

15:54.200 --> 15:55.060
Your Highness!

15:55.320 --> 15:56.980
What's wrong, Your Highness?

15:57.630 --> 15:58.560
Are you alright?

15:59.080 --> 15:59.850
Don't worry.

16:00.030 --> 16:01.290
I'll stay by your side.

16:01.320 --> 16:02.120
I won't leave.

16:10.360 --> 16:11.560
Is this what you need?

16:31.610 --> 16:33.590
Were you feeling ill just now,
Your Highness?

16:33.590 --> 16:35.720
Shall I summon an imperial physician?

16:37.190 --> 16:38.590
That won't be necessary.

16:48.600 --> 16:49.870
Your Highness is unwilling to
see a physician.

16:49.870 --> 16:50.790
Is it because you don't want Susha

16:50.790 --> 16:51.920
to know you're sick?

16:56.080 --> 16:56.880
Rest assured.

16:57.360 --> 16:58.750
I will keep your secret

16:58.960 --> 17:00.690
and won't mention it to anyone.

17:02.390 --> 17:03.850
Thank you, Your Highness.

17:06.750 --> 17:08.030
I'll head back now.

17:09.720 --> 17:11.250
Rest early, Your Highness.

17:22.069 --> 17:24.069
I know what you want, Your Highness,

17:26.720 --> 17:28.520
so you need not worry about this.

17:29.720 --> 17:30.320
Take care.

17:54.000 --> 17:56.200
Is the clue you were talking about here?

17:57.400 --> 17:58.200
Of course not.

18:00.060 --> 18:02.350
So you deliberately tricked me into
coming here?

18:02.350 --> 18:04.480
There's a Zi'an Lake in Pingling City.

18:04.640 --> 18:06.200
In the past, when I was in a bad mood

18:06.200 --> 18:07.680
or had troubles,

18:08.510 --> 18:09.550
besides practicing archery,

18:09.550 --> 18:10.750
I would find a boat

18:11.790 --> 18:12.960
and lie down in it,

18:13.110 --> 18:14.830
letting it drift on the water,

18:14.830 --> 18:16.290
floating away.

18:16.370 --> 18:17.440
As it drifted,

18:17.640 --> 18:19.650
all my troubles would drift away too.

18:19.650 --> 18:21.480
Are you remembering things from the past?

18:21.480 --> 18:24.010
I've been remembering quite a bit,
on and off.

18:24.140 --> 18:25.510
Why are you still standing there?

18:25.510 --> 18:26.440
Come and join me.

18:54.550 --> 18:56.680
I've heard about what happened today.

18:57.470 --> 18:58.460
So your father

18:58.550 --> 18:59.270
really had someone

18:59.270 --> 19:00.880
take your place at the Ancestral Ceremony?

19:00.880 --> 19:02.540
I don't care about any of that.

19:04.590 --> 19:06.400
What you actually care more about is

19:06.400 --> 19:07.600
your mother's death,

19:08.310 --> 19:08.920
right?

19:11.030 --> 19:13.110
How did your mother pass away?

19:20.830 --> 19:22.550
If you don't want to talk about it,

19:22.550 --> 19:23.550
you don't have to.

19:27.480 --> 19:28.440
15 years ago,

19:29.070 --> 19:29.830
Zhuang Shen and his daughter

19:29.830 --> 19:31.630
captured several Jinxiu spies.

19:31.960 --> 19:33.160
Those people actually confessed

19:33.160 --> 19:35.160
that my mother was also a Jinxiu spy.

19:36.770 --> 19:38.240
Then her personal maid

19:38.240 --> 19:40.550
also came forward to testify against her,

19:40.550 --> 19:41.270
claiming that my mother

19:41.270 --> 19:43.310
had secretly met with people from Jinxiu.

19:43.310 --> 19:45.110
All evidence pointed to her.

19:48.550 --> 19:50.210
Is this Her Majesty's letter?

19:51.790 --> 19:52.370
Yes,

19:52.400 --> 19:53.400
this is indeed Her Majesty's

19:53.400 --> 19:54.460
letter of treason.

19:55.400 --> 19:57.060
Later, my mother passed away.

19:57.350 --> 19:58.550
Those Jinxiu spies

19:58.590 --> 20:00.250
committed suicide in prison,

20:00.310 --> 20:01.350
and her personal maid

20:01.350 --> 20:03.350
also died of illness shortly after.

20:05.030 --> 20:07.560
It was all Zhuang Shen
and Empress Zhuang's doing, right?

20:07.560 --> 20:08.820
They were very careful

20:09.030 --> 20:10.830
and destroyed all the evidence.

20:11.200 --> 20:13.200
But I know it must have been them.

20:14.480 --> 20:16.340
If you say so, then it must be true.

20:16.920 --> 20:18.030
Although my hand injury

20:18.030 --> 20:19.480
hasn't completely healed yet,

20:19.480 --> 20:21.030
within 50 paces,

20:21.110 --> 20:22.920
I can still shoot with perfect accuracy.

20:22.920 --> 20:23.850
If you need me to,

20:24.030 --> 20:25.440
I can take the lives of Zhuang Shen

20:25.440 --> 20:26.840
and his daughter for you.

20:31.110 --> 20:32.430
If you kill them now,

20:33.270 --> 20:34.160
my mother will never

20:34.160 --> 20:35.420
have her name cleared.

20:36.790 --> 20:37.680
You mentioned before

20:37.680 --> 20:38.920
that your study companions,

20:38.920 --> 20:40.270
the old nursemaids and others

20:40.270 --> 20:41.610
all betrayed your trust

20:41.640 --> 20:42.640
and wanted to harm you.

20:42.640 --> 20:43.960
This must also be connected

20:43.960 --> 20:45.720
to Zhuang Shen and his daughter, right?

20:45.720 --> 20:46.450
Yes, indeed.

20:46.880 --> 20:48.960
They wanted to get rid of me completely,

20:48.960 --> 20:51.310
but of course I wouldn't let them
get what they want.

20:51.310 --> 20:52.480
When I was 14,

20:52.590 --> 20:54.070
I secretly left the imperial palace

20:54.070 --> 20:56.470
and joined the army
under a false identity.

20:56.880 --> 20:58.270
During those years, everyone

20:58.270 --> 20:59.730
truly believed I was dead.

21:04.660 --> 21:06.160
From now on, I'll protect you

21:06.160 --> 21:07.960
and make sure no one can hurt you.

21:08.290 --> 21:10.700
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

21:11.290 --> 21:14.170
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

21:14.670 --> 21:16.870
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

21:17.450 --> 21:20.770
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

21:21.210 --> 21:23.450
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

21:23.810 --> 21:27.440
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

21:24.920 --> 21:25.720
What's wrong?

21:26.030 --> 21:27.890
Why are you looking at me like that?

21:27.890 --> 21:33.610
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

21:29.220 --> 21:31.550
This is the first time
anyone has said to me

21:31.720 --> 21:33.050
that they'd protect me.

21:33.750 --> 21:34.920
After all, it was because of me

21:34.070 --> 21:35.840
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

21:34.960 --> 21:36.400
that you fell out with your father.

21:36.400 --> 21:37.640
I don't like being in anyone's debt.

21:36.520 --> 21:40.210
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert? ♪

21:38.310 --> 21:39.040
From now on,

21:39.160 --> 21:40.680
as long as I'm still in your residence,

21:40.480 --> 21:42.370
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

21:40.900 --> 21:42.630
it'll be my duty to protect you.

21:42.840 --> 21:46.570
♪ Who sighs for me,
enduring separations? ♪

21:47.110 --> 21:49.040
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

21:49.610 --> 21:52.460
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

21:52.900 --> 21:54.170
♪ The clouds perish ♪

21:53.680 --> 21:56.930
[Murong Residence]

22:10.480 --> 22:11.110
Father,

22:11.200 --> 22:12.510
are you still reviewing documents?

22:12.510 --> 22:14.110
You've already returned to Yujing City.

22:14.110 --> 22:16.110
Why worry about those military affairs?

22:16.110 --> 22:17.650
You really think

22:17.720 --> 22:18.630
you're still in your prime?

22:18.280 --> 22:20.640
[Marquis of Changle, Murong Zhong]

22:18.960 --> 22:21.820
Don't you care about
your medicine-weakened body?

22:25.160 --> 22:26.670
I've always told you

22:26.830 --> 22:28.750
that military matters, big or small,

22:28.750 --> 22:29.500
must be handled

22:29.500 --> 22:31.220
on the same day they arise.

22:31.440 --> 22:32.360
Otherwise,

22:32.550 --> 22:34.880
if the border's security is compromised,

22:34.880 --> 22:35.880
how could I live up to

22:35.880 --> 22:37.240
His Majesty's trust and reliance

22:37.240 --> 22:39.000
over all these years?

22:41.270 --> 22:42.550
If His Majesty truly relied on you,

22:42.550 --> 22:45.950
he wouldn't have sent you to the northwest
in the first place.

22:46.160 --> 22:47.160
You little brat.

22:47.180 --> 22:49.380
What nonsense are you muttering about?

22:49.510 --> 22:50.790
I just feel sorry for you.

22:50.790 --> 22:51.830
Back then, you fought

22:51.830 --> 22:52.790
alongside His Majesty

22:52.790 --> 22:54.160
and ended up with
all those injuries and ailments.

22:54.160 --> 22:55.270
His Majesty knows this perfectly well,

22:55.270 --> 22:56.510
so why would he still send you to

22:56.510 --> 22:57.510
that bitterly cold place in the northwest?

22:57.510 --> 22:58.640
Every time you come back,

22:58.640 --> 23:00.510
you're bedridden for 10 days
or even half a month.

23:00.510 --> 23:01.480
If you ask me,

23:01.640 --> 23:03.790
you might as well retire early.

23:05.200 --> 23:06.130
What do you know?

23:06.400 --> 23:07.560
As loyal subjects,

23:08.590 --> 23:10.720
we must be ready to die on the frontier,

23:10.720 --> 23:12.180
wrapped in our own cloaks.

23:12.290 --> 23:13.830
Only then can we truly be worthy of

23:13.830 --> 23:14.640
the high positions and generous rewards

23:14.640 --> 23:16.480
His Majesty has bestowed upon us.

23:16.480 --> 23:17.200
Right.

23:19.310 --> 23:21.640
Today, I had an audience with His Majesty,

23:21.640 --> 23:22.970
and His Majesty asked me

23:23.680 --> 23:25.750
if I wanted to be transferred
back to the capital.

23:25.750 --> 23:26.400
Really?

23:28.000 --> 23:29.290
I refused.

23:29.830 --> 23:30.920
As you said,

23:31.160 --> 23:32.200
the northwestern border

23:32.200 --> 23:33.680
is a bitterly cold and harsh place.

23:33.680 --> 23:34.750
None of the court officials

23:34.750 --> 23:35.920
are willing to be stationed there.

23:35.920 --> 23:37.210
But that's precisely

23:37.720 --> 23:39.720
why I must stay
at the northwestern border.

23:39.720 --> 23:40.580
Only by doing so

23:41.160 --> 23:43.290
can I help ease His Majesty's burdens.

23:45.750 --> 23:47.010
Yes, Father.

23:47.160 --> 23:48.620
You're absolutely right.

23:48.640 --> 23:49.240
Also,

23:50.070 --> 23:51.210
His Majesty told me

23:51.510 --> 23:53.530
he wants to train you properly.

23:53.880 --> 23:55.440
He plans to take advantage of

23:55.440 --> 23:56.910
the Princess's wedding

23:57.270 --> 23:58.130
to temporarily

23:58.240 --> 23:59.840
hand you the position of

23:59.880 --> 24:00.680
Commander-in-Chief of the Imperial Guards,

24:00.680 --> 24:03.110
putting you in charge of
the capital's security.

24:03.110 --> 24:04.510
Leading the Imperial Guards?

24:04.510 --> 24:05.050
Father,

24:05.200 --> 24:07.060
you didn't agree to it... Did you?

24:22.070 --> 24:23.450
What day is it today?

24:23.810 --> 24:25.750
Why are so many people
releasing lotus lanterns?

24:25.750 --> 24:27.340
The Princess is getting married.

24:27.340 --> 24:28.480
The common people all want to share

24:28.480 --> 24:29.940
in the royal family's joy.

24:30.030 --> 24:30.790
That's why they're

24:30.790 --> 24:33.030
releasing lotus lanterns here
for blessings.

24:33.030 --> 24:34.360
So what wish do you have?

24:34.640 --> 24:35.360
Tell me,

24:35.480 --> 24:37.410
and I can help you make it come true.

24:57.960 --> 24:59.640
I wish to grow old together

24:59.680 --> 25:01.080
with the person by my side

25:01.270 --> 25:03.200
and live a peaceful and happy life.

25:07.160 --> 25:08.360
My wish

25:08.270 --> 25:09.270
[I wish to grow old together
with the person by my side]

25:08.920 --> 25:10.070
is the same as what's written here.

25:09.300 --> 25:10.230
[and live a peaceful and happy life.]

25:10.690 --> 25:13.830
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

25:11.270 --> 25:12.040
What is it?

25:14.260 --> 25:17.650
♪ Fold the heaven and earth
to make my wings ♪

25:15.240 --> 25:16.970
It's a wish about you, anyways.

25:17.960 --> 25:19.260
Exactly what wish is it?

25:18.270 --> 25:19.710
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

25:19.280 --> 25:19.940
Let me see.

25:20.150 --> 25:23.300
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

25:22.590 --> 25:23.830
You're so petty.
Why won't you let me see it?

25:23.830 --> 25:24.970
My wish is...

25:25.750 --> 25:28.640
♪ I thought this life
would drift like a solitary sail ♪

25:26.260 --> 25:27.070
What is it?

25:29.360 --> 25:32.290
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

25:29.510 --> 25:30.440
My wish is

25:30.480 --> 25:31.650
for you to be

25:32.720 --> 25:35.670
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

25:34.590 --> 25:35.590
safe and happy.

25:36.080 --> 25:38.300
♪ My eyes ♪

25:37.510 --> 25:38.720
That's all?

25:39.110 --> 25:40.650
♪ Once I was like a frost-edged sword ♪

25:41.130 --> 25:42.720
♪ Sweeping across the battlefield
in gleaming light ♪

25:41.240 --> 25:42.700
Isn't being safe and happy

25:42.720 --> 25:44.150
the most important thing?

25:43.920 --> 25:46.160
♪ Never thought who'd lay me to rest ♪

25:45.310 --> 25:45.830
Yes,

25:46.400 --> 25:48.080
♪ Once unstoppable and sharp ♪

25:46.790 --> 25:48.350
it's very important indeed.

25:48.350 --> 25:50.870
♪ Now my heart's tied to you ♪

25:48.590 --> 25:49.450
What about you?

25:50.350 --> 25:51.480
What's your wish?

25:51.390 --> 25:53.570
♪ Thinking of you day and night ♪

25:52.880 --> 25:54.410
My wish is the same as yours.

25:55.730 --> 25:58.080
♪ I suddenly realize
ripples are spreading ♪

25:58.710 --> 26:02.530
♪ Melting the frost,
lingering in my heart ♪

26:01.510 --> 26:02.920
What's written on that lotus lantern

26:02.920 --> 26:03.880
is also my wish.

26:03.150 --> 26:04.470
♪ The light between your brows ♪

26:04.860 --> 26:06.700
♪ Is the kind of bloom ♪

26:07.190 --> 26:09.830
♪ That I love the most ♪

26:08.110 --> 26:09.110
You mean...

26:09.590 --> 26:11.000
I wish you can be safe and happy.

26:10.370 --> 26:12.790
♪ I truly feel I can forgive it all ♪

26:12.960 --> 26:13.880
That's all?

26:13.580 --> 26:17.150
♪ The sky's vast and the road's long,
but with you by my side ♪

26:14.070 --> 26:14.550
Yeah.

26:15.200 --> 26:16.350
Didn't you just say

26:16.640 --> 26:17.750
safety is the most important thing?

26:17.540 --> 26:19.390
♪ The twists and turns don't count ♪

26:19.820 --> 26:24.280
♪ I can tell with tears
that I have not lived in vain ♪

26:24.890 --> 26:28.480
♪ Not in vain ♪

26:26.550 --> 26:27.310
Right.

26:36.830 --> 26:37.310
You...

26:38.060 --> 26:38.860
It's nothing.

26:40.030 --> 26:41.760
Feng Suige, listen carefully.

26:42.270 --> 26:43.270
If you encounter any

26:43.270 --> 26:44.380
unpleasant things in the future,

26:44.290 --> 26:46.870
♪ I suddenly realized what it means
to be unmatched ♪

26:44.830 --> 26:45.550
don't hide alone

26:45.550 --> 26:47.120
in that dark ancestral hall anymore.

26:47.120 --> 26:51.370
♪ What it means to long,
what it means to burn ♪

26:48.270 --> 26:49.070
Do you hear me?

26:50.110 --> 26:51.070
I understand.

26:51.810 --> 26:53.300
♪ The scars left along the way ♪

26:53.720 --> 26:54.750
♪ In an instant, because of you ♪

26:55.030 --> 26:58.430
♪ With a smile, they ascend like feathers,
spreading in all directions ♪

27:08.680 --> 27:09.550
I haven't had any more nightmares

27:09.550 --> 27:10.680
these past few days.

27:10.830 --> 27:13.110
There's no need to
put out these flowers anymore.

27:13.110 --> 27:14.440
I'm just placing some bouquets

27:14.440 --> 27:16.370
to freshen up the room, that's all.

27:16.830 --> 27:18.830
If you have spare money for flowers,

27:19.000 --> 27:20.270
you might as well save it

27:20.270 --> 27:22.400
to improve the food in your residence.

27:22.680 --> 27:24.510
Plain soup and simple dishes every day

27:24.510 --> 27:26.510
doesn't seem fitting for a First Prince.

27:26.510 --> 27:28.000
The military funds are tight,

27:28.000 --> 27:30.000
so I have to deduct from my own share.

27:30.550 --> 27:31.810
What do you want to eat?

27:31.830 --> 27:33.880
I'll have the kitchen make it for you.

27:33.880 --> 27:34.790
Don't bother.

27:35.000 --> 27:36.350
I'm not that delicate.

27:37.350 --> 27:38.210
Your Highness.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.300
Your Highness.

27:43.400 --> 27:45.130
News just came from the palace:

27:45.510 --> 27:46.790
today, the Second Prince spoke up

27:46.790 --> 27:47.680
for Your Highness in court

27:47.680 --> 27:49.200
and nearly angered His Majesty.

27:49.200 --> 27:51.110
It was only after the senior officials
persuaded him

27:51.110 --> 27:53.400
that he finally accepted the position of
secondary officiant.

27:53.400 --> 27:55.000
When Chengyang learns about

27:55.510 --> 27:56.310
the grudges between me,

27:56.310 --> 27:58.170
his mother, and his grandfather,

27:58.680 --> 27:59.830
what will he think?

28:02.270 --> 28:03.400
Don't overthink it.

28:04.000 --> 28:05.720
Nothing can be perfect.

28:06.160 --> 28:08.160
As long as your conscience is clear.

28:08.960 --> 28:09.560
By the way,

28:09.960 --> 28:11.070
I suddenly remembered some clues

28:11.070 --> 28:12.270
about Meng Junran.

28:13.000 --> 28:14.480
Before falling off the cliff,

28:14.480 --> 28:15.480
I heard him say

28:15.510 --> 28:16.270
he delivered a batch of silver

28:16.270 --> 28:17.610
to Xia Jingshi.

28:18.400 --> 28:19.920
When will the military funds

28:19.920 --> 28:21.450
you promised be delivered?

28:21.680 --> 28:23.400
Yesterday, 100,000 taels of silver

28:23.400 --> 28:24.480
were already entrusted to

28:24.480 --> 28:25.590
the Rongtong Escort Agency for transport.

28:25.590 --> 28:27.090
The agency responsible for
escorting that batch of silver

28:27.090 --> 28:29.690
was the Rongtong Escort Agency
of Yujing City.

28:29.840 --> 28:31.160
I know this escort agency.

28:31.160 --> 28:33.320
They'll take on any escort job,
no matter how risky,

28:33.320 --> 28:35.790
and they're quite well-known
in Yujing City.

28:35.790 --> 28:36.650
Go investigate

28:37.160 --> 28:39.240
and find out who sent goods to Xia Jingshi

28:39.240 --> 28:40.640
through the Rongtong Escort Agency.

28:40.640 --> 28:41.240
Yes.

28:48.560 --> 28:50.880
[Jingming Garden]

29:00.980 --> 29:01.840
Your Highness.

29:02.590 --> 29:03.440
Feng Suige will

29:03.440 --> 29:05.480
attend the Ancestral Ceremony tomorrow.

29:05.480 --> 29:06.400
I will take this opportunity

29:06.400 --> 29:07.530
to meet with Wu Ying.

29:10.130 --> 29:11.660
Find a way to notify Wu Ying,

29:11.840 --> 29:13.500
but make sure no one finds out.

29:14.200 --> 29:14.550
Yes.

29:15.880 --> 29:17.070
Your Highness, please take a look at this.

29:17.070 --> 29:18.030
I calculated the time

29:18.030 --> 29:19.110
and made some inquiries.

29:19.110 --> 29:20.240
Before Miss Yixiao fell off the cliff,

29:20.240 --> 29:22.200
someone did contact
the Rongtong Escort Agency

29:22.200 --> 29:23.590
to escort a batch of goods

29:23.590 --> 29:25.120
to Pingling City in Jinxiu.

29:25.550 --> 29:26.550
It was this woman.

29:27.030 --> 29:28.160
Based on the owner's description,

29:28.160 --> 29:29.880
I had someone draw this portrait.

29:29.880 --> 29:30.960
It's just that since it's been too long,

29:30.960 --> 29:32.310
the owner only remembers vaguely.

29:32.310 --> 29:33.440
It's said this woman

29:33.440 --> 29:34.890
seemed quite generous,

29:35.110 --> 29:37.110
but she wouldn't let anyone
inquire about her identity.

29:37.110 --> 29:38.240
She said that after arriving in
Pingling City,

29:38.240 --> 29:41.100
someone would surely be there
to receive the goods.

29:41.610 --> 29:42.720
This woman must have

29:42.720 --> 29:44.830
some connection with that Meng Junran.

29:44.830 --> 29:45.830
Send more people.

29:46.030 --> 29:47.110
Anyone who bears

29:47.110 --> 29:48.680
even the slightest resemblance
to this portrait—

29:48.680 --> 29:50.160
investigate them all thoroughly.

29:50.160 --> 29:51.100
Yes.

29:57.920 --> 29:58.780
Your Highness,

29:59.000 --> 30:00.330
Junior Marquis is here.

30:00.440 --> 30:01.240
Why is he here?

30:01.590 --> 30:03.310
Why can't I be here?

30:10.130 --> 30:11.330
I didn't want to come,

30:12.070 --> 30:13.160
but I heard from my father

30:13.160 --> 30:16.090
that you got in some bad luck,
so I came to check on you.

30:16.270 --> 30:17.290
I didn't know

30:17.480 --> 30:18.400
that your father

30:18.400 --> 30:19.830
could order you around.

30:20.240 --> 30:21.840
If you missed me, just say so.

30:22.330 --> 30:24.260
Don't use your father as an excuse.

30:30.570 --> 30:32.590
I planned to drink with you last night,

30:32.590 --> 30:33.510
but just before leaving,

30:33.510 --> 30:34.310
I suddenly learned that His Majesty

30:34.310 --> 30:36.790
wants me to be some
Imperial Guards' Commander-in-Chief.

30:36.790 --> 30:37.770
So I decided I didn't want to see

30:37.770 --> 30:39.100
any of you court people.

30:39.240 --> 30:40.270
It even made me

30:40.270 --> 30:41.530
lose sleep last night.

30:42.070 --> 30:43.830
Isn't that as good as His Majesty
sentencing me to death?

30:43.830 --> 30:44.920
Why did His Majesty suddenly ask you

30:44.920 --> 30:46.070
to be the Commander-in-Chief
of the Imperial Guards?

30:46.070 --> 30:46.970
Who knows?

30:47.000 --> 30:48.330
He said it's to train me.

30:48.750 --> 30:49.880
But you know your father.

30:49.880 --> 30:51.330
What he says and what he thinks

30:51.330 --> 30:52.390
are never the same.

30:52.750 --> 30:53.790
Rather than being an official,

30:53.790 --> 30:55.180
I prefer spending time with the beauties
in my mansion,

30:55.180 --> 30:56.550
traveling and enjoying life.

30:56.550 --> 30:57.680
I was thinking of running away

30:57.680 --> 30:58.440
before the imperial edict

30:58.440 --> 30:59.920
was officially issued,

31:00.160 --> 31:01.220
but then I thought,

31:01.510 --> 31:03.920
if I became the Commander-in-Chief
of the Imperial Guards,

31:03.920 --> 31:05.580
I'd surely be able to help you.

31:06.000 --> 31:07.590
Don't you do that for me.

31:08.440 --> 31:09.530
I know

31:09.680 --> 31:11.030
you hate being tied down the most.

31:11.030 --> 31:11.890
Don't say that.

31:12.350 --> 31:13.110
You already have

31:13.110 --> 31:14.640
little influence at court.

31:14.680 --> 31:17.480
Now that His Majesty has even had
the Second Prince

31:17.480 --> 31:19.530
take your place at the Ancestral Ceremony,

31:19.530 --> 31:20.590
how could I leave you behind

31:20.590 --> 31:21.990
and enjoy freedom alone?

31:24.310 --> 31:25.920
So lovey-dovey.

31:26.030 --> 31:28.090
Why don't you two just go get married?

31:28.880 --> 31:29.880
You're jealous, right?

31:29.880 --> 31:31.480
You're definitely jealous.

31:35.240 --> 31:37.960
The beauty in this portrait is...

31:40.160 --> 31:41.620
Is it her that you painted?

31:42.160 --> 31:43.000
Me? Paint her?

31:43.000 --> 31:44.000
No need to hide it.

31:45.000 --> 31:46.400
The one you painted is me.

31:46.960 --> 31:48.620
What's the problem with that?

31:53.590 --> 31:54.110
Right.

31:54.790 --> 31:55.650
I did paint you.

31:56.830 --> 31:57.480
How is it?

31:58.160 --> 31:58.960
Do you like it?

31:59.680 --> 32:00.740
Of course I like it.

32:01.070 --> 32:02.680
My husband painted it for me himself.

32:02.680 --> 32:03.880
I absolutely love it.

32:07.510 --> 32:09.230
I've had enough.

32:09.250 --> 32:10.580
I need to go wash my eyes.

32:10.720 --> 32:12.580
I'm leaving. No need to see me out.

32:18.790 --> 32:19.880
In Yujing City,

32:20.350 --> 32:21.510
whether from noble families

32:21.510 --> 32:22.910
or entertainment boats,

32:23.000 --> 32:23.730
he knows most

32:23.750 --> 32:24.810
of the women there.

32:25.760 --> 32:26.880
With his help,

32:26.920 --> 32:28.750
our investigation will be much easier.

32:28.750 --> 32:29.510
Why didn't you

32:29.510 --> 32:30.670
let me tell him just now?

32:30.670 --> 32:31.760
I just feel

32:32.000 --> 32:34.380
the fewer people who know about this,
the better.

32:34.380 --> 32:36.110
I have no hostility toward him.

32:36.270 --> 32:37.440
It's just that every time I see him,

32:37.440 --> 32:38.710
I feel uncomfortable.

32:39.130 --> 32:40.400
I can't explain why.

32:41.240 --> 32:43.100
Could it be that you're really...

32:43.590 --> 32:44.450
Jealous of him?

32:47.720 --> 32:48.310
Alright.

32:50.310 --> 32:50.770
Come on.

32:55.700 --> 32:57.260
From now on, these secrets

32:57.720 --> 32:59.050
will be kept between us.

32:59.270 --> 33:00.550
I won't tell anyone else.

33:00.550 --> 33:01.280
Is that okay?

33:04.780 --> 33:05.830
You and Junior Marquis

33:05.830 --> 33:07.110
seem very close.

33:07.880 --> 33:09.920
I've never seen you
treat anyone like that.

33:09.920 --> 33:10.830
Why are you two

33:10.920 --> 33:11.790
so close?

33:13.270 --> 33:15.800
We experienced life and death together.

33:16.230 --> 33:17.510
When we were little, the two of us

33:17.510 --> 33:19.920
went with the Elder Marquis
to inspect the border,

33:19.920 --> 33:22.030
and we were suddenly attacked
by assassins.

33:22.030 --> 33:24.160
It was thanks to him
and the Elder Marquis

33:24.160 --> 33:25.480
that I survived.

33:26.400 --> 33:28.130
No wonder you trust him so much.

33:29.560 --> 33:30.550
This guy

33:31.070 --> 33:31.920
should be considered

33:31.920 --> 33:32.790
my best friend.

33:33.440 --> 33:34.480
Between us,

33:34.920 --> 33:36.000
we could even

33:36.000 --> 33:37.800
give up our lives for each other.

33:44.140 --> 33:44.700
[Jingming Garden]

33:47.160 --> 33:47.720
Not bad.

33:48.960 --> 33:49.580
Today

33:49.640 --> 33:51.110
is my first day in office.

33:51.200 --> 33:52.390
Listen up, you all.

33:52.430 --> 33:55.920
[Jingming Garden]

33:52.680 --> 33:54.070
Everyone going in and out of here

33:54.070 --> 33:55.310
must be thoroughly checked

33:55.310 --> 33:56.150
and rechecked,

33:56.150 --> 33:58.110
especially that Prince of Zhennan.

33:58.110 --> 33:59.350
Whenever he comes out of this gate,

33:59.350 --> 34:00.630
you all need to keep a close eye on him

34:00.630 --> 34:02.290
and monitor him carefully...

34:02.550 --> 34:04.040
To ensure his safety.

34:04.240 --> 34:05.230
Do you understand?

34:05.020 --> 34:09.870
[Jingming Garden]

34:05.270 --> 34:06.070
Yes, My Lord!

34:14.150 --> 34:15.409
Come on, the umbrella.

34:16.150 --> 34:17.590
I don't want to get tanned.

34:17.590 --> 34:18.110
My Lord!

34:18.230 --> 34:18.760
My Lord!

34:20.920 --> 34:22.710
My Lord, something terrible has happened!

34:22.710 --> 34:23.760
What's so terrible?

34:23.760 --> 34:25.360
Everything seems fine to me.

34:25.440 --> 34:26.230
It's not like

34:26.710 --> 34:28.110
the Prince of Zhennan
could disappear, right?

34:28.110 --> 34:29.310
The Prince of Zhennan

34:29.320 --> 34:30.719
has indeed disappeared.

35:24.800 --> 35:25.330
Brother!

35:29.670 --> 35:30.800
I'm sorry, Brother.

35:31.420 --> 35:33.890
I shouldn't have taken your place
as the secondary officiant.

35:33.890 --> 35:35.420
What are you talking about?

35:35.590 --> 35:37.050
I'm not displeased at all.

35:37.150 --> 35:38.920
Seeing you grown up
and becoming so sensible

35:38.920 --> 35:39.940
makes me happy.

35:40.710 --> 35:41.920
Besides, for my sake,

35:41.940 --> 35:43.760
you even risked angering His Majesty.

35:43.760 --> 35:45.110
That proves I still hold

35:45.150 --> 35:46.630
an important place in your heart.

35:46.630 --> 35:47.550
Of course.

35:47.760 --> 35:48.570
That being said, between us brothers,

35:48.570 --> 35:50.840
does it matter who serves as
the secondary officiant?

35:50.840 --> 35:52.560
I'm just worried that those officials

35:52.560 --> 35:53.810
and the common people

35:53.940 --> 35:55.510
will gossip about you behind your back.

35:55.510 --> 35:56.630
Then let them be.

35:57.320 --> 35:58.770
You've done nothing wrong,

35:58.770 --> 36:00.430
so you shouldn't feel guilty.

36:04.590 --> 36:05.440
Have you

36:05.440 --> 36:07.040
grown even taller recently?

36:09.630 --> 36:11.110
It seems I've grown quite a bit indeed.

36:11.110 --> 36:11.740
Suige!

36:13.710 --> 36:14.640
Why are you here?

36:14.800 --> 36:16.030
While the guards were changing shifts,

36:16.030 --> 36:18.630
Xia Jingshi slipped out
through the back door.

36:26.000 --> 36:28.130
Wu Ying pays respect to Your Eminence.

36:32.730 --> 36:35.150
[Wu Ying from the death camp]

36:33.800 --> 36:34.930
In enemy territory,

36:35.440 --> 36:37.700
one must act with caution in all matters.

36:37.760 --> 36:38.420
One careless moment

36:38.420 --> 36:40.420
could leave you dead with no burial.

36:40.550 --> 36:41.400
You've remained undercover until now

36:41.400 --> 36:43.400
without Susha detecting anything.

36:43.780 --> 36:44.610
Good job.

36:45.730 --> 36:47.190
Thank you, Your Eminence.

36:47.890 --> 36:49.160
After the wedding,

36:49.230 --> 36:50.920
I'll find a way to leave Yujing.

36:50.920 --> 36:52.240
While I'm not here,

36:52.630 --> 36:53.460
you'll lead our men

36:53.460 --> 36:54.990
and coordinate with Susha.

36:57.480 --> 36:58.340
Take this

36:58.630 --> 37:01.030
and make contact at the alley
behind the dance house.

37:01.030 --> 37:01.890
Your Eminence,

37:01.960 --> 37:02.630
why must we

37:02.630 --> 37:04.760
risk our lives for those Susha people?

37:07.750 --> 37:09.000
I spoke out of turn.

37:15.140 --> 37:20.010
[Jingming Garden]

37:18.400 --> 37:19.800
So that's what happened.

37:20.110 --> 37:21.710
You couldn't even keep watch
over one person.

37:21.710 --> 37:22.830
If His Lordship blames us,

37:22.830 --> 37:23.480
none of you can escape punishment!

37:23.480 --> 37:24.150
And you all!

37:24.550 --> 37:25.550
On my very first day in office,

37:25.550 --> 37:26.960
you already embarrassed me.

37:26.960 --> 37:27.670
And you too!

37:36.800 --> 37:37.540
He's back.

37:42.660 --> 37:47.690
[Jingming Garden]

37:51.440 --> 37:52.570
Where have you been?

37:53.440 --> 37:54.840
Why should I report to you

37:54.880 --> 37:56.230
where I went?

37:56.480 --> 37:57.960
Who did you just meet?

37:59.630 --> 38:01.960
I felt stifled in there,
so I went for a walk.

38:01.960 --> 38:02.820
Well, I came to Susha

38:02.820 --> 38:03.820
for the marriage alliance,

38:03.820 --> 38:04.840
not as a hostage.

38:04.860 --> 38:06.320
First Prince, it seems
you're in no position

38:06.320 --> 38:07.880
to restrict my freedom, are you?

38:07.880 --> 38:09.480
I was just worried about you.

38:10.000 --> 38:11.500
If you were careless

38:11.880 --> 38:13.810
and died on some street out there,

38:13.880 --> 38:15.040
that would be bad.

38:16.710 --> 38:18.040
Are you threatening me?

38:19.590 --> 38:20.880
So what if he is?

38:22.110 --> 38:23.480
In Jinxiu, you're the Prince of Zhennan.

38:23.480 --> 38:24.070
But here, you're nothing more than

38:24.070 --> 38:25.110
a son-in-law marrying into
the royal family.

38:25.110 --> 38:25.630
Yao.

38:26.440 --> 38:29.240
Speak more respectfully to
the Prince of Zhennan.

38:30.060 --> 38:32.390
[Jingming Garden]

38:30.480 --> 38:31.640
From today on,

38:31.760 --> 38:32.890
without my written order,

38:32.890 --> 38:34.900
no one is to leave his side
even for a moment.

38:34.900 --> 38:36.160
If he slips away again,

38:36.230 --> 38:37.880
I'll have your heads.

38:38.550 --> 38:39.320
Yes, My Lord!

38:39.630 --> 38:40.590
Escort him back to his residence.

38:40.590 --> 38:42.850
[Jingming Garden]

38:54.280 --> 38:58.030
[Jingming Garden]

38:56.090 --> 38:56.820
How was that?

38:56.920 --> 38:58.580
Was my authority convincing?

38:59.190 --> 39:01.110
Make sure you keep a close eye on him.

39:01.110 --> 39:02.070
Rest assured.

39:04.410 --> 39:08.090
[Jingming Garden]

39:13.400 --> 39:15.530
That was obviously a dead-end valley,

39:15.630 --> 39:17.160
but when I caught up,

39:17.550 --> 39:19.010
Xia Jingshi had vanished.

39:19.800 --> 39:20.630
Later, I searched

39:20.630 --> 39:22.560
all the nearby streets and alleys,

39:22.880 --> 39:23.710
but still couldn't find

39:23.710 --> 39:24.640
any trace of him.

39:26.320 --> 39:27.580
It's my incompetence.

39:28.070 --> 39:29.930
Please punish me, Your Highness.

39:32.590 --> 39:33.720
It's not your fault.

39:34.190 --> 39:35.590
Xia Jingshi's escape this time

39:35.590 --> 39:36.710
wasn't an accident.

39:36.710 --> 39:38.310
He planned it in advance.

39:38.550 --> 39:39.360
Someone must have been

39:39.360 --> 39:41.020
helping him from the outside.

39:42.000 --> 39:43.930
But with the wedding approaching,

39:44.070 --> 39:45.280
why would Xia Jingshi

39:45.300 --> 39:47.160
choose to take a risk at such a timing?

39:47.160 --> 39:48.760
Besides, what could he have done

39:48.760 --> 39:49.890
in such a short time?

39:50.110 --> 39:51.280
Or perhaps...

39:52.230 --> 39:53.560
He went to meet someone?

39:56.630 --> 39:57.490
Your Highness!

40:00.400 --> 40:00.840
Your Highness.

40:00.840 --> 40:01.510
Any news?

40:01.710 --> 40:02.150
Yes.

40:02.710 --> 40:03.650
I checked every woman

40:03.650 --> 40:04.780
who resembles the one

40:04.780 --> 40:05.510
in the portrait

40:05.510 --> 40:06.240
and is of similar age

40:06.240 --> 40:07.400
throughout Yujing City,

40:07.400 --> 40:08.090
and I finally pinpointed

40:08.090 --> 40:09.670
a top performer in the dance house
named Ruyan.

40:09.670 --> 40:10.360
She must be the one

40:10.360 --> 40:11.360
we're looking for.

40:11.360 --> 40:12.620
Prepare the carriage.

40:13.590 --> 40:14.910
I'll go see for myself.

40:17.760 --> 40:19.310
Drink a bit more.

40:19.760 --> 40:21.360
Can't you let me take a break?

40:22.190 --> 40:22.920
If the medicine gets cold,

40:22.920 --> 40:24.180
it'll lose its effect.

40:24.960 --> 40:26.820
Father, drink it while it's warm.

40:29.080 --> 40:30.150
Father,

40:30.400 --> 40:32.460
what's this medicine you're taking?

40:32.880 --> 40:34.440
Father, are you unwell?

40:36.230 --> 40:37.150
Why haven't I

40:37.150 --> 40:39.610
heard anything from the Imperial Hospital?

40:40.150 --> 40:41.070
Does Mother

40:41.150 --> 40:42.070
know about this?

40:42.070 --> 40:43.400
Allow me to take a break.

40:43.980 --> 40:45.270
I'll drink it later.

40:45.550 --> 40:46.290
These are

40:46.440 --> 40:48.100
just some calming medicines.

40:49.190 --> 40:49.960
My child.

40:51.070 --> 40:53.110
How come you're showing me

40:53.110 --> 40:54.510
such filial piety today?

40:54.670 --> 40:56.400
My wedding day is approaching.

40:57.670 --> 40:59.670
I'm reluctant to leave you, Father.

41:00.550 --> 41:02.510
What's there to be reluctant about?

41:02.510 --> 41:03.190
You're just marrying

41:03.190 --> 41:04.710
the Prince of Zhennan, aren't you?

41:04.710 --> 41:05.400
Besides,

41:05.760 --> 41:07.090
you won't be far from me,

41:07.190 --> 41:08.450
so why the reluctance?

41:08.480 --> 41:09.880
But still, I can't always be

41:09.880 --> 41:12.010
by your and Mother's side to serve you.

41:12.920 --> 41:14.070
Could it be that

41:14.150 --> 41:15.760
you don't like having me by your side,
Father?

41:15.760 --> 41:16.560
Of course I do.

41:17.110 --> 41:18.550
How could I not?

41:18.630 --> 41:20.230
Then why did you say all that?

41:25.130 --> 41:26.160
I just

41:27.510 --> 41:29.360
don't want you to worry.

41:31.550 --> 41:32.150
Remember,

41:33.440 --> 41:34.700
after you're married,

41:34.920 --> 41:36.250
no matter what happens,

41:36.840 --> 41:38.320
you must let me know.

41:38.880 --> 41:41.070
I'll always be your support.

41:41.480 --> 41:42.710
The entire Susha

41:42.960 --> 41:44.230
is your support.

41:44.920 --> 41:45.980
Do you understand?

41:47.320 --> 41:48.120
I understand.

41:49.400 --> 41:50.460
Thank you, Father.

41:52.010 --> 41:53.150
Well, I won't drink this.

41:53.150 --> 41:54.680
Give me a massage, will you?

41:55.800 --> 41:57.330
Remember to drink it later.

41:57.440 --> 41:58.150
All right.

42:01.920 --> 42:03.880
Daughters are the best.

42:05.960 --> 42:06.710
Your Majesty.

42:06.710 --> 42:07.980
[Su]

42:06.960 --> 42:08.320
The token has been retrieved.

42:08.320 --> 42:09.550
Shall I put it back to its original place?

42:09.550 --> 42:11.980
[Su]

42:13.480 --> 42:14.580
Yes, put it back.

42:16.150 --> 42:17.080
Your Highness.

42:17.190 --> 42:18.550
His Majesty hasn't been

42:18.590 --> 42:20.160
this happy for many days.

42:21.280 --> 42:22.670
Forgive me for speaking out of turn again.

42:22.670 --> 42:23.840
I shall take my leave now.

42:23.840 --> 42:25.370
Thank you for your service.

42:28.970 --> 42:30.500
Father, if you're tired,

42:30.670 --> 42:32.670
close your eyes and rest for a while.

42:32.800 --> 42:33.400
All right.
